  "limitations": [
    "P02 remains in progress. No physical x86, userspace, glibc/systemd, full ISA, stress, or release qualification is claimed.",
    "Each unit gate has 11 reported XCTest cases with one optional PVH boot skip, and a separately disabled physical-reference Swift test. Successful bounded unit tests cannot substitute for either gate.",
    "All three newly retained real-kernel probes reset without an accepted userspace workload receipt or clean ACPI poweroff.",
    "The host tuple is arm64 macOS 27 beta (26A5425a), Xcode 26.6 (17F109), SDK 26.5, classified experimental. A passing schema or optimized build is not a release qualification.",
    "The run-12 probe invocation names FS/GS implementation commit 904485e88 while its frozen full source snapshot matches 313ede248; both immutable identities are retained and distinguished.",
    "Six generated ignored FFI inputs remain hash-bound separately from the committed sources and overlays; generated runner executable identities are recorded without vendoring the binaries.",
    "CI evidence records actionlint, bash syntax, and shellcheck only. The required two-tier job has not been executed by these checks.",
    "Every source/test result after run 13 is excluded, including the later physical-memory negative-length patch.",
    "Guest-handled exceptions are reflected only when the guest console reports them; runner fault fields describe terminal exits. The bounded trace is not exhaustive fault history.",
    "Matching timer/ExtINT failure consoles across interpreter and baseline-JIT suggest a shared device path only. Different UUIDs, a 28-instruction delta, and no RAM comparison prevent any full-machine parity claim."
  ]
